      "raw_text": "Pagbati sa mga kawani ng lokal na pamahalaan na ginawaran ng QC Service Award at Career and Self-Development Award! ✨\n\nNarito ang mga QC Service Awardee ngayong Lunes:\n\n- Rosario Chi ng Department of Building Official (30 years in service)\n- Johnny Sianghio ng Office of the City Assessor (41 years in service)\n- Bienvenida Sabutanan ng Traffic and Transport Management Department (39 years in service)\n- Aleta Macabangon ng Office of the Secretary to the Sangguniang Panlungsod (36 years in service)\n- Victoria Orozco ng Department of Public Order and Safety (27 years in service)\n- Homer Pilar ng Quezon City Public Library (33 years in service)\n- Gavino Colorado ng Housing, Community Development and Resettlement Department (23 years in service)",
      "cleaned_text": "Pagbati sa mga kawani ng lokal na pamahalaan na ginawaran ng QC Service Award at Career and Self-Development Award! ✨ Narito ang mga QC Service Awardee ngayong Lunes: - Rosario Chi ng Department of Building Official (30 years in service) - Johnny Sianghio ng Office of the City Assessor (41 years in service) - Bienvenida Sabutanan ng Traffic and Transport Management Department (39 years in service) - Aleta Macabangon ng Office of the Secretary to the Sangguniang Panlungsod (36 years in service) - Victoria Orozco ng Department of Public Order and Safety (27 years in service) - Homer Pilar ng Quezon City Public Library (33 years in service) - Gavino Colorado ng Housing, Community Development and Resettlement Department (23 years in service)",
      "english_translation": "Greeting local government personnel who have been awarded the QC Service Award and Career and Selff-Dvelopment Award!  cells present the QC Service Awardees today Monday: - Rosario Chi of the Department of Building Official (30 years in service) - Johnnyanghio of the Office of the City Assssor (41 years in service) - Bienvenida San of Traffic and Transport Management Department (39 years in service) - Aleta Macatica of the Secretary to the Panlus) Beforesland City’s",
